WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.506
(Music)    

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.508
Woman passenger:
Just how many of these things
have you dealt with?

00:00:09.343 --> 00:00:11.011
Woman driver:
More than most people feel
comfortable knowing about.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.263
(Music)

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.098
Woman passenger:
And how many
times have you failed?

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:18.101
More times than most people
would feel comfortable knowing
about.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:22.022
(Music)

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:24.107
Woman:
What if it does these
things for a reason?

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:26.652
(Music)

00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:28.278
Maybe all this always happened.

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:30.364
(Music)

00:00:30.364 --> 00:00:32.032
Man:
Maybe you were always meant
to come back with me.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:35.244
(Music)

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:36.245
I gotta figure this out.

00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:38.247
I may have something.

00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:39.665
Great, buckle up.

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:42.793
(Music)

00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:44.378
You're a superhero, Grandpa!

00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:46.255
(Music)

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:47.256
Cool.

00:00:47.256 --> 00:00:49.049
(Music)

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.092
Man:
That's not a coincidence.

00:00:50.092 --> 00:00:51.551
(Music)

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:52.594
You gotta do something big.

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:53.595
(Music)

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:54.930
I'll see you on the other side.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:01:06.900
(Music)

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.487
It's a pretty good story, you be
nice...

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:11.488
...I'll tell it to you sometime.

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:14.491
(Music)

